            {
                <div class="rail-empty">
                    <span class="icon-chip sm soft" aria-hidden="true"><i class="bi bi-clock-history"></i></span>
                    <span>No activity yet. Proposals, milestones and payments show up here as they happen.</span>
                </div>
            }
        </section>

        @* ---------- Tips ---------- *@
        <section class="ui-card dash-section" data-reveal>
            <div class="ui-card-head" style="margin-bottom:0;">
                <div class="ui-card-title rail-title">Tips for Better Campaigns</div>
                <span class="icon-chip sm violet" aria-hidden="true"><i class="bi bi-lightbulb"></i></span>
            </div>
            <ul class="check-list">
                <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> Set a platform and niche so Smart Match can rank creators for you.</li>
                <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> Split deliverables into milestones with clear due dates.</li>
                <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> Shortlist a few creators and compare reach and engagement side by side.</li>
                <li><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> Review submitted proof promptly so creators get paid on time.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        @* ---------- FAQ ---------- *@
        <section class="ui-card dash-section" data-reveal>
            <div class="ui-card-head" style="margin-bottom:2px;">
                <div class="ui-card-title rail-title">Frequently Asked Questions</div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-list">
                <details>
                    <summary>How do creators join my campaign?<i class="bi bi-chevron-right"></i></summary>
                    <p>Once published, a campaign is open to creator applications. You can also invite creators directly from their profile. Each application or invite becomes a proposal you confirm or decline.</p>
                </details>
                <details>
                    <summary>What happens when I accept a proposal?<i class="bi bi-chevron-right"></i></summary>
                    <p>Accepting starts an active collaboration with that creator. You then track each deliverable as a milestone with its own amount and due date.</p>
                </details>
                <details>
                    <summary>When do I pay a creator?<i class="bi bi-chevron-right"></i></summary>
                    <p>Only after a milestone's proof of post has been approved. You then release the payment and pay it through bKash or Nagad. Nothing is charged before you confirm.</p>
                </details>
                <details>
                    <summary>How does Smart Match score creators?<i class="bi bi-chevron-right"></i></summary>
                    <p>It compares each creator with your campaign's platform, niche and engagement criteria and shows the reasons behind every score. There's no hidden ranking.</p>
                </details>
                <details>
                    <summary>Can I edit a campaign after publishing?<i class="bi bi-chevron-right"></i></summary>
                    <p>Yes. Open the campaign from Campaigns to update its details, targeting or milestone plan, or to change its status.</p>
                </details>
            </div>
        </section>

        @* ---------- Need help ---------- *@
        <section class="help-card">
            <h3>Need Help?</h3>
            <p>Questions about a campaign, a creator or a payment? Our support team is here to help.</p>
            <a href="/contact?accountType=Brand#contactForm">Contact Support <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></a>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 400 170" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="dashboard-help-wave" x1="0" y1="1" x2="1" y2="0"><stop stop-color="#0955ca" stop-opacity="0"/><stop offset=".65" stop-color="#168cff" stop-opacity=".5"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#783dff" stop-opacity=".15"/></linearGradient></defs><path d="M-20 160 C100 50 140 220 260 105 S350 85 420 20 L420 190 H-20Z" fill="url(#dashboard-help-wave)"/><path d="M-20 164 C110 90 140 230 270 120 S360 70 420 40" fill="none" stroke="#2799ff" stroke-opacity=".4"/></svg>
        </section>

    </aside>

</div>

<section class="cta-banner dash-cta">
    <div>
        <h3>Find creators who fit your next campaign</h3>
        <p>Browse creators by platform, niche, followers and engagement &mdash; then shortlist or invite them in a click.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="dash-cta-actions">
        <a href="/Campaigns/Create" class="is-quiet"><i class="bi bi-plus-lg"></i> Create Campaign</a>
        <a href="/Influencers">Discover Creators <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></a>
